/target
**/target

# Python bytecode cache from inventory helper scripts
**/__pycache__/

# Generated by vantage-ui when it scaffolds/opens an inventory:
# Per-model redb caches — regenerated at runtime by vantage-ui. Ignore
# everywhere, not just under inventory/, so no app can leak them into git.
**/.cache/
# Installed agent-skill bundles (reproducible — installed under .agents/skills,
# treated like vendored deps).
**/.agents/

# Per-app local secrets — inventory/.env can hold real credentials (AWS keys,
# tokens). Never commit; .env.example documents the shape.
**/inventory/.env
# Everything vantage-ui rewrites on open, from the running build: the JSON
# schemas, the per-kind folder README, and the AGENTS.md pointer file. Commit
# them and they go stale the moment the build moves, so every version bump
# becomes a diff nobody wrote. Matched without an `inventory/` prefix because
# apps use both layouts — apps/<app>/inventory/<kind>/ and apps/<app>/<kind>/.
#
# Kind folders are listed one by one rather than globbed as */README.md: apps
# also keep hand-written READMEs a level down (periscope/cluster/,
# launch-control/server/), and those must stay tracked. A new kind folder
# needs a line here.
**/*-schema-*.json
**/AGENTS.md
**/manifest.yaml
**/datasource/README.md
**/table/README.md
**/page/README.md
**/menu/README.md
**/action/README.md
**/view/README.md
**/form/README.md

# Downloaded app binary / DMG (CI fetches these at runtime)
/vantage.dmg
/Vantage*.app
latest.json

.DS_Store
apps/vantage-leads/.env
